1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,040
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,740
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,310
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:07,480
All right.

5
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:09,780
Just deal, man. No cut.

6
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:12,250
- No cut?
- Deal.

7
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,950
- Wish you luck.
- The luck is mine.

8
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,890
All right, come to me.

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:24,800
Fold.

10
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,460
You're folding again?

11
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,200
I can fold if my hand is bad.

12
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,100
How can we keep our game going
if you fold all the time?

13
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:34,470
Stop picking a fight with me.

14
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:35,940
I can fold if my hand is bad.

15
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:39,340
Still, a game is only good
if there's a decent pot.

16
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:41,810
- You haven't changed at all.
- Deal the cards again.

17
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,620
This guy plays by zero rules.
Seriously, what's wrong with you?

18
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,720
- Why do you always fold?
- Deal again.

19
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:49,520
Deal again?
Why are you ruining the game?

20
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:51,060
Deal, jerk.
Let's reset and go again.

21
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,120
Reset, my foot.

22
00:00:58,930 --> 00:00:59,930
Ae Sook.

23
00:01:00,930 --> 00:01:01,970
Did you come to see me?

24
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:17,380
Let go of me.

25
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:19,980
It's me.

26
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:24,290
Ae Sook, you haven't changed a bit.

27
00:01:25,190 --> 00:01:26,220
Let go.

28
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:27,630
Let go!

29
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,430
- Hey.
- What's going on?

30
00:01:34,470 --> 00:01:36,200
Mr. Choi...

31
00:01:36,330 --> 00:01:37,870
Mr. Choi, how are you here?

32
00:02:00,930 --> 00:02:03,530
You look just like I did...

33
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,260
thirty years ago.

34
00:02:08,070 --> 00:02:09,670
Stuck in the corner of a room,

35
00:02:10,570 --> 00:02:13,910
just like that woman
who was trampled by you.

36
00:02:16,010 --> 00:02:17,710
Even carrying a child,

37
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,780
she fought to survive,

38
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:21,410
trying to dodge
at least one of your punches.

39
00:02:22,010 --> 00:02:23,050
Just like...

40
00:02:23,110 --> 00:02:24,550
that Joo Ae Sook.

41
00:02:29,220 --> 00:02:30,290
I'm sorry.

42
00:02:30,890 --> 00:02:33,830
Ae Sook, I was wrong.

43
00:02:34,730 --> 00:02:35,790
Listen carefully.

44
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,200
The Joo Ae Sook
you're looking for...

45
00:02:39,830 --> 00:02:41,470
died a long time ago.

46
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:46,300
Mention the name Joo Ae Sook
one more time,

47
00:02:47,370 --> 00:02:50,110
and I'll personally bury you
in concrete.

48
00:02:51,110 --> 00:02:52,210
Understood?

49
00:02:58,120 --> 00:02:59,120
Wrap this up.

50
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,560
What about our daughter?

51
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:10,930
I heard you gave birth
to our daughter.

52
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:16,500
She died a very long time ago.

53
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:31,450
(PR Director Joo Mi Ran)

54
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,520
"Our" daughter?

55
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,990
She's my daughter.

56
00:03:35,750 --> 00:03:38,290
She's the greatest masterpiece
I've ever created.

57
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:42,360
She's not someone trash like you
can even dare to mention.

58
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,030
My daughter...

59
00:03:46,030 --> 00:03:48,200
will become the owner of Cheongma.

60
00:03:49,930 --> 00:03:51,040
Just wait and see.

61
00:03:51,540 --> 00:03:53,500
I'll make sure of it.

62
00:03:59,210 --> 00:04:00,950
Director, is something wrong?

63
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,650
It's nothing serious.

64
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:09,850
Lately, the Chairman and the CEO...

65
00:04:10,660 --> 00:04:12,590
have not been getting along,
as you know.

66
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:14,630
It's nothing new for Mom and Dad.

67
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,560
You of all people know...

68
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:18,730
that they're strangely competing
over the company.

69
00:04:19,460 --> 00:04:21,930
I just let it be.
It's always been like that.

70
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,100
At times like this, you need
to step up and play mediator.

71
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:26,700
What am I supposed to do?

72
00:04:26,770 --> 00:04:29,140
It's not like they have
equal ownership of the company.

73
00:04:29,340 --> 00:04:32,680
Present a third option
with you in the middle.

74
00:04:33,910 --> 00:04:34,980
What do you mean?

75
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:39,950
You said the CEO and the Chairman
are competing over the company.

76
00:04:41,690 --> 00:04:44,960
If you, as a neutral party
between them, take over Cheongma,

77
00:04:45,490 --> 00:04:47,090
wouldn't they both agree to it?

78
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,330
This is your chance
to be recognized...

79
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:51,860
as the official successor
of Cheongma.

80
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,470
Could that work?

81
00:04:55,470 --> 00:04:57,570
This might just be your chance.

82
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,740
Then where should I start?

83
00:05:00,910 --> 00:05:03,510
First, to inherit the shares,

84
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:06,280
you need to solidify your position
as the leader of Shoejoy.

85
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:15,290
Come in.

86
00:05:15,950 --> 00:05:17,860
- Mr. Seok Jin.
- Yes?

87
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,960
I have something to say.

88
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:21,660
What is it?

89
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:23,630
Tomorrow,

90
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:26,300
I'm going to draw
with the nice lady.

91
00:05:27,670 --> 00:05:29,170
The nice lady as in Eun Seol?

92
00:05:29,530 --> 00:05:32,200
- Yes.
- Did you make plans with her?

93
00:05:32,770 --> 00:05:36,070
I texted her, and she said yes.

94
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:41,410
If you're going to color and draw,
can't you go with Hae Ra instead?

95
00:05:41,810 --> 00:05:44,320
Hae Ra's a designer too,
so she draws really well.

96
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,480
I don't want to.

97
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:49,220
I like the nice lady...

98
00:05:49,290 --> 00:05:53,420
much, much, much more.

99
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,460
So you already made plans
with Eun Seol?

100
00:06:00,330 --> 00:06:01,330
Yes.

101
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,070
Tomorrow, the caregiver
from the center...

102
00:06:03,130 --> 00:06:04,870
will drop me off at the company.

103
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,240
Okay?

104
00:06:07,710 --> 00:06:09,410
All right. Have fun then.

105
00:06:10,010 --> 00:06:11,010
Really?

106
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:14,510
Thank you, Mr. Seok Jin.
I'm so excited.

107
00:06:22,620 --> 00:06:26,560
Chief Cha's brand
is being promoted by my wife?

108
00:06:27,530 --> 00:06:30,730
Yes, she's already finished
the promotional shoot.

109
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:33,560
She knows I'm uncomfortable
with Chief Cha,

110
00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:36,400
so she's helping him
just to spite me.

111
00:06:36,730 --> 00:06:40,470
Unbelievable.
She can be quite childish.

112
00:06:41,110 --> 00:06:45,340
Well, let her try.
We'll see how effective it is.

113
00:06:47,210 --> 00:06:49,880
Here's the list of board members
for the scholarship program.

114
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:51,180
Right.

115
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:54,920
Did you talk to the board members
in advance?

116
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,920
Yes.

117
00:06:55,990 --> 00:06:57,990
I've finished the groundwork.

118
00:06:58,120 --> 00:07:00,860
Keep a close eye on my wife.

119
00:07:00,930 --> 00:07:02,860
Find out what she's planning.

120
00:07:03,290 --> 00:07:04,300
Yes,

121
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,800
I'll check frequently
and report back.

122
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,070
Good. Director Joo.

123
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,700
Are you free this evening?

124
00:07:16,470 --> 00:07:17,910
Since you helped me deal
with Chairman Kim,

125
00:07:18,910 --> 00:07:21,650
I'd like to buy you a meal.

126
00:07:23,010 --> 00:07:25,520
All right,
I'll keep my schedule open.

127
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:30,020
(Head of Legal Affairs,
Seo Hyun Jae)

128
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,830
- Do you mean Director Joo Mi Ran?
- Yes, her.

129
00:07:36,490 --> 00:07:39,230
At first, I thought
she might be Eun Seol's mother,

130
00:07:39,660 --> 00:07:41,030
so I went to see her once.

131
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:44,740
Apparently, Eun Seol was
her high school friend's daughter.

132
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:52,480
(Yeongsu High School)

133
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:57,980
- Attorney Seo.
- Hey, Eun Seol.

134
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:01,250
- Aren't you done?
- I'm good to go.

135
00:08:01,790 --> 00:08:03,490
You must be hungry.
What should we eat?

136
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:05,790
You pick the menu today.

137
00:08:05,990 --> 00:08:07,530
What should we have?

138
00:08:08,690 --> 00:08:10,290
I know a good place. Follow me.

139
00:08:10,390 --> 00:08:11,400
Sure.

140
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:16,330
(Head of Legal Affairs,
Seo Hyun Jae)

141
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:28,510
My gosh.

142
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:30,410
You're here, Mr. Choi.

143
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:33,120
Nothing special happened
today, right?

144
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:35,850
Of course. I spent all day...

145
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:37,860
just staying right here.

146
00:08:38,690 --> 00:08:42,160
If you experience any discomfort,
please contact me anytime.

147
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:45,230
Right, well...

148
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:47,530
By the way...

149
00:08:50,430 --> 00:08:51,440
Are you...

150
00:08:51,770 --> 00:08:54,410
going to come here every day
to monitor me?

151
00:08:58,210 --> 00:09:00,210
Monitor you?

152
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:03,310
It's not like that.
I'm just checking in on you.

153
00:09:09,950 --> 00:09:11,560
To see if you were safe overnight.

154
00:09:12,690 --> 00:09:14,230
And to make sure
you're not doing anything foolish.

155
00:09:15,930 --> 00:09:19,230
I'm naturally the type of person
who deeply respects my elders.

156
00:09:19,630 --> 00:09:21,900
Right. Of course.

157
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:26,340
That's absolutely
who you are, Mr. Choi.

158
00:09:36,410 --> 00:09:38,120
I hear you have plans
with my mother today.

159
00:09:38,950 --> 00:09:41,690
Yes, we decided to draw together
at a cafe.

160
00:09:43,690 --> 00:09:45,990
I feel bad that my mother
is taking up your time.

161
00:09:47,260 --> 00:09:49,190
It's fine. No one's forcing me.

162
00:09:50,900 --> 00:09:51,900
And...

163
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:54,630
I don't mean anything else by it.

164
00:09:57,470 --> 00:09:59,570
It isn't because she's your mother.

165
00:10:00,040 --> 00:10:02,710
Spending time with her
actually heals me.

166
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,740
That's why I'm seeing her.

167
00:10:07,510 --> 00:10:09,580
I'm grateful you think that way.

168
00:10:10,310 --> 00:10:12,650
So please don't worry
about it, Chief.

169
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,950
I don't want to cause
misunderstandings either.

170
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,760
Should I pick her up
when you're done?

171
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,160
No.

172
00:10:21,590 --> 00:10:23,760
I'll walk her
to the apartment complex.

173
00:10:26,900 --> 00:10:28,070
Okay, thanks.

174
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:31,900
Then...

175
00:10:41,850 --> 00:10:44,350
First, to inherit the shares,

176
00:10:44,820 --> 00:10:47,120
you need to solidify your position
as the leader of Shoejoy.

177
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:54,190
Let's all work overtime today.

178
00:10:56,130 --> 00:10:58,600
I'm thinking of moving up the drafts
for next season.

179
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:00,360
We can't just rely
on the initial lineup...

180
00:11:00,430 --> 00:11:01,600
and sit back like this.

181
00:11:02,970 --> 00:11:05,400
Ko Eun Seol, organize the preview
and report it.

182
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:08,470
You two, write a report
comparing us to our competitors.

183
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:10,310
- Got it.
- Sure.

184
00:11:14,810 --> 00:11:19,380
Nice lady, are we still on
for drawing later?

185
00:11:30,530 --> 00:11:31,630
Ms. Kang,

186
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:34,430
I already have plans for today.

187
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:38,040
I'll finish the work you assigned
by tomorrow.

188
00:11:39,140 --> 00:11:40,140
What?

189
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:42,510
You're just going to ignore
my orders?

190
00:11:42,640 --> 00:11:45,680
I haven't left work on time once
this past week.

191
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:48,210
Please excuse me just for today.

192
00:11:49,450 --> 00:11:50,510
Are you kidding me?

193
00:11:57,320 --> 00:12:00,120
Are you sure you can
finish everything by tomorrow?

194
00:12:01,090 --> 00:12:02,690
Yes, I can.

195
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:06,230
All right, then you can head out.

196
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:25,450
Nice lady,
please color this bear nicely.

197
00:12:25,450 --> 00:12:26,480
Sure.

198
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:34,790
In the past, Mr. Seok Jin
drew very well too.

199
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:36,630
Really?

200
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,960
Yes.

201
00:12:38,300 --> 00:12:40,730
If he went out of the lines
even just a little,

202
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:43,000
he'd burst out crying.

203
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:45,740
I can imagine.

204
00:12:46,270 --> 00:12:48,440
Looks like he was
a total perfectionist even as a kid.

205
00:12:48,570 --> 00:12:49,610
He sure was.

206
00:12:49,940 --> 00:12:52,110
He'd color outside
the lines himself,

207
00:12:52,180 --> 00:12:56,650
cry, throw a tantrum,
and color it all over again.

208
00:12:58,420 --> 00:13:00,250
I see he hasn't changed.

209
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:04,290
Actually, in the past,
Mr. Seok Jin...

210
00:13:04,390 --> 00:13:07,560
always had a runny nose.

211
00:13:07,730 --> 00:13:09,830
But he doesn't anymore.

212
00:13:11,400 --> 00:13:14,530
You're right.
He doesn't have a runny nose now.

213
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:19,100
But he wouldn't
even wipe it himself,

214
00:13:19,170 --> 00:13:21,210
so I had to wipe it for him.

215
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:23,570
He said it was dirty
and refused to touch it.

216
00:13:24,510 --> 00:13:26,410
A neat freak and a perfectionist.

217
00:13:26,940 --> 00:13:28,680
That's still exactly
how he is today.

218
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:29,950
Totally.

219
00:13:37,350 --> 00:13:38,460
Director Joo,

220
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:41,090
we've known each other for decades,

221
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:45,100
but this is the first time
it's just the two of us eating.

222
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,470
Well, we were always
with the Chairman.

223
00:13:55,040 --> 00:13:57,040
After this recent incident
involving Chairman Kim,

224
00:13:58,040 --> 00:14:00,510
my trust in you
has grown even stronger.

225
00:14:04,980 --> 00:14:07,750
Of course, I trusted you before,

226
00:14:08,420 --> 00:14:09,620
but now I feel like...

227
00:14:10,250 --> 00:14:12,320
you have truly become my person,

228
00:14:12,990 --> 00:14:15,060
someone I can trust with everything.

229
00:14:31,410 --> 00:14:32,410
Excuse me.

230
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:34,510
What kind of wine
would you like me to prepare?

231
00:14:37,150 --> 00:14:38,180
I'll go...

232
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:40,550
with a light white wine.

233
00:14:41,620 --> 00:14:43,650
What would your wife like to have?

234
00:14:46,190 --> 00:14:48,360
- No, I'm...
- She'll...

235
00:14:53,230 --> 00:14:54,470
have the same.

236
00:14:54,700 --> 00:14:56,600
Sure, I'll bring that right over
for you.

237
00:15:07,140 --> 00:15:08,410
Right this way.

238
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:20,260
Isn't that CEO Kang
and Director Joo?

239
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:34,340
Now,

240
00:15:34,970 --> 00:15:37,040
it won't be long until we become...

241
00:15:38,310 --> 00:15:39,580
a perfect family.

242
00:15:42,110 --> 00:15:43,380
Everything is finally...

243
00:15:43,610 --> 00:15:46,680
falling back into
its rightful place.

244
00:15:49,650 --> 00:15:51,090
Enjoy it while you can.

245
00:15:52,590 --> 00:15:54,790
Because everything
will soon be mine.

246
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:08,140
The social adaptation
training program...

247
00:16:08,210 --> 00:16:10,040
is summarized separately
on page nine.

248
00:16:10,640 --> 00:16:12,240
Okay, I'll check it.

249
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:14,040
Secretary Choi.

250
00:16:16,010 --> 00:16:17,680
Can I ask you something?

251
00:16:18,050 --> 00:16:19,920
Yes. What is it?

252
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:23,690
I happened to see you passing by
the day before yesterday.

253
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:27,120
What business did you have
with Director Jung?

254
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:29,530
Wait, the day before yesterday?

255
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:32,230
The day before yesterday,

256
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:34,630
I briefly met Director Jung
in the lobby.

257
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:36,670
He said he left something
in his car,

258
00:16:36,930 --> 00:16:38,370
so I just brought it to him.

259
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,440
I take it you saw that.

260
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,910
Is that so?

261
00:16:43,210 --> 00:16:46,080
Of course.
The Chairman specifically told us...

262
00:16:46,140 --> 00:16:47,680
not to make contact
with the directors.

263
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:51,650
But I couldn't just ignore
a simple request like that.

264
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:03,090
My husband and Director Joo?

265
00:17:03,430 --> 00:17:05,060
Yes, that's what I said.

266
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:08,470
Anyone would think
they were a married couple.

267
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:11,170
Oh, right.

268
00:17:11,470 --> 00:17:12,570
Yesterday?

269
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:15,270
There was an executive meeting
for Cheongma Foods.

270
00:17:15,670 --> 00:17:18,410
He said they had
a meal together afterward.

271
00:17:19,210 --> 00:17:20,280
Is that what he said?

272
00:17:21,150 --> 00:17:23,080
But I had no idea...

273
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:26,250
that CEO Kang
was such a sweet person.

274
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:30,550
The way he looked at Director Joo
was different from usual.

275
00:17:32,890 --> 00:17:35,690
My husband might seem a bit cold,

276
00:17:36,030 --> 00:17:38,300
but he's quite affectionate
with his employees.

277
00:17:38,630 --> 00:17:41,200
Anyway, keep a close eye
on CEO Kang.

278
00:17:41,670 --> 00:17:43,630
In this circle,
even if she is a subordinate,

279
00:17:43,930 --> 00:17:46,770
rumors can create problems
out of thin air.

280
00:17:48,270 --> 00:17:51,280
Right, thanks for your concern.

281
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:08,260
Since the cafe is closed today,
I ended up with some free time.

282
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:10,790
One plate
would've been plenty for us.

283
00:18:10,990 --> 00:18:13,260
We'll enjoy this, Mi Rae.

284
00:18:13,730 --> 00:18:17,270
I thought you were going to
take the meat and let it all rot.

285
00:18:17,370 --> 00:18:20,240
Boss, you're the best.
I'll enjoy this.

286
00:18:20,300 --> 00:18:23,540
Thank you for the food. Let's eat!

287
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:35,650
I'm going to marry someone
who's really good at cooking.

288
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:39,990
Right, that's why I thought...

289
00:18:40,490 --> 00:18:42,090
I married the right woman.

290
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:44,190
Looking back now,

291
00:18:44,830 --> 00:18:47,760
I realize I never once
cooked a meal for her myself.

292
00:18:48,370 --> 00:18:50,070
You should be relieved.

293
00:18:50,470 --> 00:18:52,270
She would've forced herself
to eat it...

294
00:18:52,470 --> 00:18:54,370
just because her husband made it.

295
00:18:55,370 --> 00:18:59,540
It's already unfair enough
that she had a short life.

296
00:18:59,810 --> 00:19:03,210
Is that so? I suppose you're right.

297
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,250
I'm going to marry someone
who cooks well...

298
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:06,720
and learn everything from her.

299
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,890
Then, I'll cook
all the meals for her.

300
00:19:09,450 --> 00:19:11,890
Find a woman first
before you say that, you punk.

301
00:19:12,490 --> 00:19:14,320
How will you ever get married
at this rate?

302
00:19:15,330 --> 00:19:16,690
Whatever. By the way, Mi Rae,

303
00:19:16,730 --> 00:19:18,330
what's the secret to this sauce?

304
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:21,730
If you really want to know,
I'll teach Eun Guk.

305
00:19:22,230 --> 00:19:24,430
I have my own special recipe.

306
00:19:25,870 --> 00:19:26,940
Sounds good.

307
00:19:27,740 --> 00:19:32,180
Mom, keep playing cards
with Mr. Choi from the butcher shop.

308
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:34,480
Won't that mean free meat every day?

309
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:37,280
Mom, want me to show you
some new card shark moves?

310
00:19:37,350 --> 00:19:40,320
Why don't you just train me to be
a professional gambler?

311
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:44,690
- Just eat up.
- This is really delicious.

312
00:20:01,770 --> 00:20:02,810
Honey.

313
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:06,110
When I remember everything,

314
00:20:07,580 --> 00:20:11,280
I'll tell our Seok Jin.

315
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:17,990
I'll tell him
what a wonderful father you were.

316
00:20:19,190 --> 00:20:22,290
I'll make sure to tell him that.

317
00:20:30,670 --> 00:20:32,570
(Hanbin Hospital:
Trauma and Stress Clinic)

318
00:20:38,110 --> 00:20:40,880
(CEO Kang Young Hoon)

319
00:20:43,210 --> 00:20:44,850
Tell Chief Cha to come see me.

320
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:46,750
Yes, sir. I'll let him know.

321
00:20:57,030 --> 00:20:58,330
Did you call for me, sir?

322
00:20:59,930 --> 00:21:02,470
How's your mother's condition?

323
00:21:04,200 --> 00:21:05,770
She's about the same.

324
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:09,210
Is she in any particular pain?

325
00:21:09,570 --> 00:21:11,010
She has become
much more emotionally stable,

326
00:21:11,070 --> 00:21:12,880
so she seems more at peace
than before.

327
00:21:13,740 --> 00:21:15,210
I see. That's a relief.

328
00:21:15,810 --> 00:21:17,180
I called you in because...

329
00:21:18,520 --> 00:21:20,480
I was wondering
if you'd like to transfer...

330
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:22,750
her regular checkups
to this hospital.

331
00:21:26,060 --> 00:21:28,590
The director here
is a close friend of mine.

332
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:32,030
The hospital also has many
prestigious neurologists.

333
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:34,060
And if I put in a good word,

334
00:21:34,230 --> 00:21:36,900
they'll pay extra attention
to your mother.

335
00:21:39,540 --> 00:21:40,970
Thank you for caring, sir.

336
00:21:41,570 --> 00:21:43,740
I'll discuss it with my mother
and let you know.

337
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,540
All right, think about it.

338
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:48,880
I will.

339
00:21:55,490 --> 00:21:58,060
(Planning Director, Cha Seok Jin)

340
00:22:04,760 --> 00:22:05,860
Are you almost done for the day?

341
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:07,960
Yes, let's go.

342
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:10,300
You've been getting off work
early lately.

343
00:22:11,130 --> 00:22:12,470
You told me
to earn some points with you.

344
00:22:12,800 --> 00:22:16,270
Lately, you're at an 80 out of 100.

345
00:22:17,210 --> 00:22:19,440
Unbelievable. Let's go.

346
00:22:28,520 --> 00:22:31,760
Anyone would think
they were a married couple.

347
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:35,630
Anyway, keep a close eye
on CEO Kang.

348
00:22:35,990 --> 00:22:38,330
In this circle,
even if she is a subordinate,

349
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:42,330
rumors can create problems
out of thin air.

350
00:22:44,740 --> 00:22:45,740
Director Joo.

351
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:49,870
Did you ever have a meal alone
with my husband?

352
00:22:50,810 --> 00:22:52,940
Excuse me? With the CEO?

353
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:56,410
Yes, just the two of you.

354
00:22:56,650 --> 00:22:59,850
Oh, right. We did a few days ago.

355
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:03,620
It was on the day you had
your alumni gathering, ma'am.

356
00:23:03,620 --> 00:23:05,560
You should've told me in advance.

357
00:23:07,860 --> 00:23:09,990
Ms. Yang must have
seen you two that day.

358
00:23:11,760 --> 00:23:13,530
She said that he should
keep his distance,

359
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:15,200
even with a subordinate.

360
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:18,740
Ms. Yang was worrying over nothing,

361
00:23:19,100 --> 00:23:20,600
but she's not entirely wrong.

362
00:23:22,140 --> 00:23:23,440
If rumors start spreading,

363
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:25,510
it'll only ruin the company's image.

364
00:23:27,310 --> 00:23:31,010
I apologize, ma'am.
I didn't think that far ahead.

365
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:34,280
From now on, whether it's a meal
or something else,

366
00:23:35,090 --> 00:23:38,320
I don't want you doing
anything alone with my husband.

367
00:23:39,160 --> 00:23:41,360
Do you understand me?

368
00:23:42,260 --> 00:23:44,090
Yes, I'll be careful.

369
00:23:57,940 --> 00:23:58,940
Here.

370
00:24:00,610 --> 00:24:01,610
What's this?

371
00:24:02,250 --> 00:24:04,750
I packed some side dishes.
Share them with your family.

372
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,980
No way. Really?

373
00:24:08,750 --> 00:24:10,850
I don't think
I should take this for free.

374
00:24:16,530 --> 00:24:17,790
Boss, give me a second.

375
00:24:43,690 --> 00:24:44,690
What's this?

376
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:47,020
What else? I'm paying for the food.

377
00:24:49,030 --> 00:24:50,660
You're paying for the food?

378
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:53,030
Yes. Please take it.

379
00:24:53,730 --> 00:24:56,270
I didn't do this to get paid.

380
00:24:57,670 --> 00:24:58,870
Of course I know that.

381
00:24:59,340 --> 00:25:02,410
I know you're just looking out
for my poor family,

382
00:25:03,270 --> 00:25:05,640
but how can I just take free food?

383
00:25:06,540 --> 00:25:08,080
I'm not that shameless.

384
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:10,750
Forget it.
I'm still not taking your money.

385
00:25:12,350 --> 00:25:13,420
Just take it.

386
00:25:14,120 --> 00:25:16,750
We need to be precise
when it comes to money.

387
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:20,990
I did this because
I care about you, Eun Guk.

388
00:25:21,960 --> 00:25:23,530
Do we really need
to keep score like this?

389
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:26,160
What?

390
00:25:27,830 --> 00:25:29,500
Forget it. Just don't eat it then.

391
00:25:44,250 --> 00:25:46,650
What's this?
Why not ask me to carry it?

392
00:25:47,280 --> 00:25:48,290
Side dishes.

393
00:25:49,120 --> 00:25:50,220
These are all side dishes?

394
00:25:51,090 --> 00:25:53,620
Then why not share some
with the neighbors?

395
00:25:53,690 --> 00:25:54,690
Forget it.

396
00:25:55,560 --> 00:25:56,960
This is all for us.

397
00:25:59,500 --> 00:26:00,500
What's wrong?

398
00:26:01,560 --> 00:26:02,870
Did you fight with Eun Guk?

399
00:26:04,270 --> 00:26:07,040
Do I look like someone
who would fight with Eun Guk?

400
00:26:07,470 --> 00:26:10,070
Why? Are we dating or something?

401
00:26:11,310 --> 00:26:15,210
Why are you getting so defensive?
I was just wondering.

402
00:26:16,780 --> 00:26:18,650
Wash your own cup before heading in.

403
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:20,320
Okay.

404
00:26:23,390 --> 00:26:26,260
Uncle, what's wrong with Mom?

405
00:26:27,660 --> 00:26:30,290
Teun Teun, here you go.

406
00:26:42,370 --> 00:26:43,440
Joo Ae Sook.

407
00:26:47,080 --> 00:26:48,650
Director Joo Mi Ran.

408
00:26:50,080 --> 00:26:52,450
Yeongsu High School.

409
00:26:55,750 --> 00:26:57,250
Taeseon Hospital.

410
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:58,560
(Joo Ae Sook? Director Joo Mi Ran?)

411
00:26:58,560 --> 00:26:59,790
(Yeongsu High School,
Taeseon Hospital)

412
00:27:05,430 --> 00:27:08,630
All right.
I'll check out the school first.

413
00:27:12,770 --> 00:27:14,270
Yeongsu High School.

414
00:27:18,880 --> 00:27:20,640
Hey, Eun Seol.

415
00:27:21,280 --> 00:27:22,950
Do you have a minute?

416
00:27:25,520 --> 00:27:27,520
Manager Na's daughter came by?

417
00:27:28,850 --> 00:27:31,820
Yes. She looked very angry.

418
00:27:32,460 --> 00:27:33,890
Oh my.

419
00:27:34,690 --> 00:27:36,630
You must've been so rattled.

420
00:27:38,560 --> 00:27:41,360
I'll see to it
that she's taken care of,

421
00:27:41,630 --> 00:27:43,300
so don't worry too much.

422
00:27:44,430 --> 00:27:45,740
Thank you, Ms. Joo.

423
00:27:47,100 --> 00:27:50,110
By the way, is Secretary Choi
helping out properly...

424
00:27:50,270 --> 00:27:51,340
with the scholarship foundation?

425
00:27:51,740 --> 00:27:52,740
Yes.

426
00:27:52,810 --> 00:27:54,910
He hasn't been with
the scholarship program for long,

427
00:27:55,010 --> 00:27:56,950
but he catches on to the work
really quickly.

428
00:27:57,310 --> 00:27:59,450
The Chairman is also very satisfied.

429
00:28:00,380 --> 00:28:01,380
Is that so?

430
00:28:01,990 --> 00:28:04,420
I'm glad to hear
he's being a big help.

431
00:28:06,220 --> 00:28:09,730
Are you running into any trouble
or difficulties at work?

432
00:28:10,260 --> 00:28:11,830
Everything's fine.

433
00:28:14,060 --> 00:28:18,070
If only Hee Jung could have seen you
doing so well.

434
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:20,740
It breaks my heart.

435
00:28:20,900 --> 00:28:22,440
(Cheongma Scholarship Foundation)

436
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:23,940
(PR Director Joo Mi Ran)

437
00:28:32,220 --> 00:28:34,250
Hey, you're here. Have a seat.

438
00:28:48,670 --> 00:28:52,500
You must be really busy these days
with Cheongma Food.

439
00:28:53,270 --> 00:28:54,970
Yes, well, a little.

440
00:28:55,940 --> 00:28:59,110
Trying to open several
Premium Food Hall locations at once...

441
00:28:59,180 --> 00:29:00,310
is a bit hectic.

442
00:29:00,610 --> 00:29:02,510
I feel bad
knowing you've been so busy.

443
00:29:02,810 --> 00:29:04,910
I worry you'll ruin your health.

444
00:29:05,620 --> 00:29:08,420
I've actually been feeling
pretty exhausted lately.

445
00:29:10,190 --> 00:29:11,350
That's why I'm saying this.

446
00:29:11,920 --> 00:29:14,460
I'm thinking of taking
some of your workload.

447
00:29:15,590 --> 00:29:17,290
What do you mean by that?

448
00:29:18,460 --> 00:29:21,030
Chief Cha's new brand, Shoejoy.

449
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:23,000
Right.

450
00:29:23,270 --> 00:29:26,840
If I oversee Chief Cha's project,

451
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,970
won't your workload decrease?

452
00:29:32,310 --> 00:29:34,010
I don't mean anything else by it.

453
00:29:35,210 --> 00:29:38,180
I'm just worried
you might collapse at this rate.

454
00:29:38,750 --> 00:29:39,920
As your wife...

455
00:29:40,550 --> 00:29:43,450
and as Cheongma's major shareholder,

456
00:29:43,990 --> 00:29:45,590
I can't just sit back and watch.

457
00:29:47,520 --> 00:29:50,360
Let me help you.

458
00:30:05,310 --> 00:30:06,710
You're flirting with him again?

459
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,850
It was quiet for a bit,
but here you go again.

460
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:20,420
Ko Eun Seol.
Did you meet Seok Jin's mom?

461
00:30:23,690 --> 00:30:25,330
Yes, I met her.

462
00:30:26,330 --> 00:30:27,930
Why would you meet Ms. Park?

463
00:30:29,030 --> 00:30:31,370
Don't tell me
you're still not over Seok Jin.

464
00:30:31,970 --> 00:30:35,140
Separate from Chief Cha,
I only met with his mother.

465
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,040
We made our own plans.

466
00:30:37,270 --> 00:30:40,580
Hey, stop clinging to him
like a pathetic fool.

467
00:30:42,550 --> 00:30:44,780
Do you think doing this
will make Seok Jin choose you?

468
00:30:44,980 --> 00:30:46,580
I don't have any lingering feelings.

469
00:30:47,150 --> 00:30:49,850
How can I get over someone
I was never actually with?

470
00:30:53,260 --> 00:30:55,390
Ko Eun Seol,
you have another thing coming.

471
00:31:11,540 --> 00:31:13,580
Did Ms. Park and Ko Eun Seol meet?

472
00:31:16,250 --> 00:31:17,250
Yes.

473
00:31:17,710 --> 00:31:21,020
You let them meet? Why?
Why do you keep letting them meet?

474
00:31:21,880 --> 00:31:24,150
I couldn't help it. My mom insisted.

475
00:31:24,590 --> 00:31:25,890
Regardless of me,

476
00:31:25,990 --> 00:31:27,890
Ko Eun Seol and my mother
are like friends.

477
00:31:28,120 --> 00:31:31,090
How can that not involve you
when you know both people so well?

478
00:31:31,390 --> 00:31:32,900
How can it have nothing
to do with you?

479
00:31:33,700 --> 00:31:35,130
Hae Ra, please hear me out.

480
00:31:36,800 --> 00:31:37,800
Forget it.

481
00:31:38,700 --> 00:31:41,840
I'm tired of hearing
the same excuses.

482
00:31:50,250 --> 00:31:51,710
You said you'd take care
of everything.

483
00:31:51,780 --> 00:31:52,880
So what now?

484
00:31:53,320 --> 00:31:55,290
Regardless of Seok Jin,
his mom and Ko Eun Seol...

485
00:31:55,350 --> 00:31:56,950
are like best friends now.

486
00:31:57,450 --> 00:31:59,890
I understand,
so please calm down first.

487
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:03,060
I hate his mother so much!

488
00:32:03,630 --> 00:32:04,660
In my perfect life,

489
00:32:04,730 --> 00:32:07,060
Seok Jin comes
as part of the package.

490
00:32:07,500 --> 00:32:09,470
He's not better than me,
but he's moderately capable,

491
00:32:09,530 --> 00:32:10,970
so he makes me stand out more.

492
00:32:11,500 --> 00:32:13,600
But his mom
keeps getting in the way.

493
00:32:14,370 --> 00:32:16,210
What did Chief Cha say?

494
00:32:16,570 --> 00:32:17,570
What do you think?

495
00:32:17,870 --> 00:32:19,180
He just told me
not to worry about it.

496
00:32:20,180 --> 00:32:23,150
(PR Director's Office)

497
00:32:23,210 --> 00:32:26,920
Can't you get Ms. Park away
from Seok Jin?

498
00:32:27,050 --> 00:32:28,120
To a nursing home or...

499
00:32:28,180 --> 00:32:30,050
No, a mental hospital.

500
00:32:30,120 --> 00:32:31,620
Just lock her up
in a place like that.

501
00:33:25,410 --> 00:33:29,310
(A Trap Called Desire)

502
00:33:29,450 --> 00:33:31,010
If my mother had been any sicker,

503
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:33,180
you would've had her locked away
in a mental hospital.

504
00:33:33,280 --> 00:33:36,820
Chief Cha, nobody calculates gains
and losses as clearly as you do.

505
00:33:36,950 --> 00:33:40,160
What are the chances she'll live
with the mind of a child forever?

506
00:33:40,390 --> 00:33:42,790
Does this mean Secretary Choi is
on CEO Kang's side?

507
00:33:42,890 --> 00:33:44,630
Is there any guy
you don't flirt with?

508
00:33:44,730 --> 00:33:47,600
What is it about you that has men
flocking to you like this?

509
00:33:47,660 --> 00:33:49,830
So there was only one student
named Joo Ae Sook?

510
00:33:49,830 --> 00:33:52,370
Will Eun Seol be able
to handle this truth?

511
00:33:52,470 --> 00:33:55,300
Because her roots and background
are different from mine.

512
00:33:55,340 --> 00:33:57,640
Have you never coveted
that position?

513
00:33:57,670 --> 00:34:00,180
You must have wanted it
at least once.

514
00:34:01,180 --> 00:34:03,150
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
